 "chunks": [
  {
   "text": "A corrupt boss",
   "w0": 0,
   "w1": 2,
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 1.251
  },
  {
   "text": "counts stolen money.",
   "w0": 3,
   "w1": 5,
   "start": 1.251,
   "end": 2.315
  },
  {
   "text": "A thief robs the street.",
   "w0": 6,
   "w1": 10,
   "start": 2.815,
   "end": 3.879
  },
  {
   "text": "And in this story,",
   "w0": 11,
   "w1": 14,
   "start": 4.379,
   "end": 5.443
  },
  {
   "text": "God has seen enough.",
   "w0": 15,
   "w1": 18,
   "start": 5.643,
   "end": 6.706
  },
  {
   "text": "A rock ten kilometres wide",
   "w0": 19,
   "w1": 23,
   "start": 7.206,
   "end": 8.909
  },
  {
   "text": "turns toward Earth.",
   "w0": 24,
   "w1": 26,
   "start": 8.909,
   "end": 9.76
  },
  {
   "text": "It falls more than",
   "w0": 27,
   "w1": 30,
   "start": 10.26,
   "end": 11.111
  },
  {
   "text": "ten kilometres every second,",
   "w0": 31,
   "w1": 34,
   "start": 11.111,
   "end": 13.026
  },
  {
   "text": "about ten times faster",
   "w0": 35,
   "w1": 38,
   "start": 13.226,
   "end": 14.715
  },
  {
   "text": "than a bullet.",
   "w0": 39,
   "w1": 41,
   "start": 14.715,
   "end": 15.566
  },
  {
   "text": "From the Moon's distance,",
   "w0": 42,
   "w1": 45,
   "start": 16.066,
   "end": 17.13
  },
  {
   "text": "under nine hours to impact.",
   "w0": 46,
   "w1": 50,
   "start": 17.33,
   "end": 18.819
  },
  {
   "text": "The boss tries",
   "w0": 51,
   "w1": 53,
   "start": 19.319,
   "end": 19.957
  },
  {
   "text": "to buy his way out.",
   "w0": 54,
   "w1": 58,
   "start": 19.957,
   "end": 21.021
  },
  {
   "text": "The thief tries to run.",
   "w0": 59,
   "w1": 63,
   "start": 21.521,
   "end": 22.585
  },
  {
   "text": "Neither helps.",
   "w0": 64,
   "w1": 65,
   "start": 23.085,
   "end": 23.723
  },
  {
   "text": "A rock this size once",
   "w0": 66,
   "w1": 70,
   "start": 24.223,
   "end": 25.287
  },
  {
   "text": "turned the ground to vapour",
   "w0": 71,
   "w1": 75,
   "start": 25.287,
   "end": 26.777
  },
  {
   "text": "at around five thousand degrees,",
   "w0": 76,
   "w1": 80,
   "start": 26.777,
   "end": 28.479
  },
  {
   "text": "wrapped the planet in dust",
   "w0": 81,
   "w1": 85,
   "start": 28.679,
   "end": 30.168
  },
  {
   "text": "within hours,",
   "w0": 86,
   "w1": 87,
   "start": 30.168,
   "end": 30.806
  },
  {
   "text": "and sent giant waves",
   "w0": 88,
   "w1": 91,
   "start": 31.006,
   "end": 32.283
  },
  {
   "text": "to most coastlines",
   "w0": 92,
   "w1": 94,
   "start": 32.283,
   "end": 33.134
  },
  {
   "text": "in two days.",
   "w0": 95,
   "w1": 97,
   "start": 33.134,
   "end": 33.772
  },
  {
   "text": "It ended the dinosaurs.",
   "w0": 98,
   "w1": 101,
   "start": 34.272,
   "end": 35.762
  },
  {
   "text": "But one scientist",
   "w0": 102,
   "w1": 104,
   "start": 36.262,
   "end": 37.326
  },
  {
   "text": "has a plan.",
   "w0": 105,
   "w1": 107,
   "start": 37.326,
   "end": 37.964
  },
  {
   "text": "In 2022, NASA crashed",
   "w0": 108,
   "w1": 111,
   "start": 38.464,
   "end": 40.791
  },
  {
   "text": "a spacecraft called DART",
   "w0": 112,
   "w1": 115,
   "start": 40.791,
   "end": 42.068
  },
  {
   "text": "into an asteroid,",
   "w0": 116,
   "w1": 118,
   "start": 42.068,
   "end": 43.345
  },
  {
   "text": "and shifted its orbit",
   "w0": 119,
   "w1": 122,
   "start": 43.545,
   "end": 44.821
  },
  {
   "text": "by thirty-two minutes.",
   "w0": 123,
   "w1": 125,
   "start": 44.821,
   "end": 46.098
  },
  {
   "text": "Find the rock early,",
   "w0": 126,
   "w1": 129,
   "start": 46.598,
   "end": 47.662
  },
  {
   "text": "and a small push",
   "w0": 130,
   "w1": 133,
   "start": 47.862,
   "end": 48.713
  },
  {
   "text": "is enough.",
   "w0": 134,
   "w1": 135,
   "start": 48.713,
   "end": 49.351
  },
  {
   "text": "Subscribe for more what-ifs.",
   "w0": 136,
